<title>USA: FGIC qualifies one issue for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies one issue for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co on Monday said that it qualified one municipal bond issue, which will be sold competitively, for insurance.</p>
<p>--East Penn School District, Pa., $12.5 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650)).</p>
